ices "answer-6803c870-457e-5570-b150-242064d877b7"] ["answer-field-7fca9031-9da9-5b3f-bdb6-33776b8b11df" :answer-field/choices "answer-ea4562b1-cb09-56bb-b332-50c8ff359486"] ["answer-field-7fca9031-9da9-5b3f-bdb6-33776b8b11df" :answer-field/choices "answer-297e3ba8-3ec2-51c0-8643-c2fb9b7d1c93"] ["answer-field-7fca9031-9da9-5b3f-bdb6-33776b8b11df" :answer-field/choices "answer-a285a759-8c2e-5fa1-8ef2-860eef0594a7"] ["answer-field-7fca9031-9da9-5b3f-bdb6-33776b8b11df" :answer-field/choices "answer-b4b289fa-1eee-5b83-b6eb-48dcbdf93bbe"] ["question-94ed6f2f-e6d7-5eca-a61d-41902b4a3cb4" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-7fca9031-9da9-5b3f-bdb6-33776b8b11df"] [17592186105726 :knowledge-point/questions "question-94ed6f2f-e6d7-5eca-a61d-41902b4a3cb4"] ["question-29481c76-b7fa-575a-9ace-40d060b32844" :question/id #uuid "29481c76-b7fa-575a-9ace-40d060b32844"] ["question-29481c76-b7fa-575a-9ace-40d060b32844" :question/math-academy-id "q-78102"] ["question-29481c76-b7fa-575a-9ace-40d060b32844" :question/problem "Calculate ${lim}_{x\\to -3}{log}_{7}⁡(x+3).$"] ["question-29481c76-b7fa-575a-9ace-40d060b32844" :question/worked-solution "Let's sketch the graph of $y={log}_{7}⁡(x+3).$\n\n![](images/0b/0b45cd648830ad88c2f21865c1bfd704783a7b5d9ce3510646ae55e98d2d95ac.png)\n\nThe function is not defined for $x\\le -3.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to (-3)^{-}}{log}_{7}⁡(x+3)=\\text{DNE}.\n$$\n\nHowever, the function is defined for $x>-3.$ Moreover,\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to (-3)^{+}}{log}_{7}⁡(x+3)=-\\infty .\n$$\n\nSince the left and right-sided limits are not equal, we have\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to -3}{log}_{7}⁡(x+3)=\\text{DNE}.\n$$"] ["question-29481c76-b7fa-575a-9ace-40d060b32844" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-ef353a81-f085-5f7c-bea2-edd66e33a6a2" :answer-field/id #uuid "ef353a81-f085-5f7c-bea2-edd66e33a6a2"] ["answer-13b7b802-4cfb-59ae-8f7e-a0a096cb02e3" :answer/id #uuid "13b7b802-4cfb-59ae-8f7e-a0a096cb02e3"] ["answer-13b7b802-4cfb-59ae-8f7e-a0a096cb02e3"